aitero-missing-key = OPENAI_API_KEY is missing. Add a literal export to ~/.zshrc or ~/.bashrc, or start Zotero with the included launcher.
aitero-error-401 = OpenAI rejected the API key (401). Check the key and restart Zotero.
aitero-error-429 = OpenAI rate limit or quota reached (429). Wait, then use Retry.
aitero-error-server = OpenAI is temporarily unavailable. Use Retry when ready; AItero does not retry automatically.
aitero-error-offline = The OpenAI request could not connect. Check the network and use Retry.
aitero-error-idle = The stream was inactive for 180 seconds and was cancelled. Use Retry if needed.
aitero-error-filter = The response was stopped by a content filter and was not added to chat history.
aitero-error-incomplete = The response ended before completion and was not added to chat history.
aitero-error-generic = The request failed and was not added to chat history. Use Retry to try again.
aitero-error-extraction = AItero could not obtain trustworthy page-by-page text from this PDF.
aitero-error-navigation = Zotero could not open that PDF page.
